Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 18:50:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Hills WP0 (work in progress): retire the bowl, first
 contracts

The circular bowl's five layers and its layout, placement, routing and
picking move to Economy/Bowl/ under the retired scene id economy-bowl
(EconomyScenes.Bowl), with BowlPresets/BowlViews kept as unused copies.
First contracts of the hill landscape: HillTypes, PeopleTypes,
ProgramTypes, HillIds, LandTween, LandSeason, LandFrameItems,
LandPlayback stub, ProgramTrace, SmvBonds stub, and additive members in
LandTypes, LandMath, LandStyle, LandView, EconomyState, EconomicLives,
SmvLayer and SmvShared.

Incomplete: the hills pipeline, the stubs of the models, the 18 views
and the hill layers are not built yet, so the economy scene's land is
empty on this branch. Compiles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
